"╭ ╭ Apply changes: shop.users ───────────────────────────────────────────────╮  "
"│ │ 1 update · 1 insert · 1 delete                                           │─╮"
"│▾│                                                                          │ │"
"│ │ id=1 · was changed or deleted since it was read. Nothing was applied.    │e│"
"│ │ Re-run the query to see the current values.                              │ │"
"│ │ Row checks (lock, no waiting)                                            │ │"
"│ │   SELECT 1 FROM "shop"."users" WHERE "id"                       expect 1 │ │"
"│ │     OPERATOR(pg_catalog.=) '1' AND "email" OPERATOR(pg_catalog.=) 'a@x'  │ │"
"│▾│     FOR UPDATE NOWAIT                                                    │ │"
"│ │   SELECT 1 FROM "shop"."users" WHERE "id"                       expect 1 │─╯"
"│ │     OPERATOR(pg_catalog.=) '2' AND "email" OPERATOR(pg_catalog.=) 'b@x'  │─╮"
"│ │     AND "nickname" IS NULL FOR UPDATE NOWAIT                             │…│"
"│ │ Writes                                                                   │ │"
"│ │ ! DELETE FROM "shop"."users" WHERE "id" OPERATOR(pg_catalog.=)  expect 1 │ │"
"│ │     '2' AND "email" OPERATOR(pg_catalog.=) 'b@x' AND "nickname" IS NULL  │ │"
"│ │   UPDATE "shop"."users" SET "email" = 'z@x' WHERE "id"          expect 1 │ │"
"│ │     OPERATOR(pg_catalog.=) '1' AND "email" OPERATOR(pg_catalog.=) 'a@x'  │ │"
"│ │     RETURNING *                                                          │ │"
"│ │                                                                          │ │"
"│ │ Runs in one transaction; commits at the end.                             │ │"
"│ │                                                                          │ │"
"│ │                  [ Cancel ]     Copy SQL       Apply                     │ │"
"╰─╰─────────────────── y apply · c copy SQL · j/k scroll · Enter/Esc cancel ─╯─╯"
" NORMAL  local-pg │ id=1 · was changed or deleted since it was read. Nothin… EN "
